msgstr "Tiada kamera web ditemui pada sistem"

#: src/onboarding.py:341
msgid ""
"Please configure your camera yourself if you are sure a compatible camera is "
"connected"
msgstr ""
"Sila konfigurasikan kamera anda sendiri jika anda pasti kamera yang serasi "
"disambungkan"

